        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 1675, 1.5 x 11 Arched Concord Multi Point Handleset with American Cylinder Below Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Concord American Cylinder Multi-Point Trim with 3-5/8 Inch c.c. is 1-1/2 inches wide and 11 inches tall. It is part of Emtek's multi point configuration # 6 collection, which is suitable for use on Milgard and Pella brand patio doors. This traditional patio door multi-point handleset is available in a wide selection of finishes ranging from classic to contemporary, for an end look that suits your personal style perfectly. The Arched Concord Multi Point Handleset with American Cylinder Below Handle is available with your choice of trim lever.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis multipoint trim set is intended to replace the trim from Milgard and Pella brand patio doors. The lock to lever distance is 3-5/8\" (92 mm). <b>This set does not come packaged with the multipoint lock mechanism</b> (the vertical rods found in multipoint patio doors that secure the door to the frame) as those are typically preinstalled in multipoint doors and cannot be replaced.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Door-configuration-6-specifcations.gif?v=1704354606\" width=\"186\" height=\"229\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Emtek Configuation #6 Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Brass Concord Multi Point Trim with Door Configuration #6:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance Between Trim and Cylinder or Thumbturn (for Keyed, Passage, and Patio Functions): 3-5/8\"</li> \r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-5/8\" - 2-3/4\" please specify.</li>\r\n<li>Solid steel spindle.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-1.x11-config-6-specificaion.pdf?v=1704262361\" target=\"new\"><b>Emtek 1675 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Pair, Active (inside):</b> Active lever inside with fixed inactive lever outside. For use as a pull or to match trim. Normally used on inactive French door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Pair, Inactive:</b> Fixed inactive levers both sides of door. For use as a pull or to match trim. Normally used on inactive French door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage:</b> Active levers both sides of door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Patio:</b> Active levers both sides of door. Thumb turn inside to lock door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles, One (1) interior thumb turn and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Active levers both sides of door. Keyed lock cylinder outside with thumb turn inside to lock door. Set includes: Two (2) backplates, Two (2) levers with spindles, Two (2) cylinder collars, One (1) american profile cylinder with key outside & thumb turn inside and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nChoose any of the different levers to complete your handleset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-8-finish.jpg?v=1704354509\" width=\"600\" height=\"102\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
